<title>UK: Eaton sites Euro admin centre in Glasgow.</title>
<headline>Eaton sites Euro admin centre in Glasgow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. engineering company Eaton Corp plans to set up a European administrative centre in Glasgow as part of a reorganisation of its back-office functions, the Scottish Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the move would create about 100 professional jobs by 1999.</p>
<p>Ohio-based Eaton makes transmissions and axles, engine components, hydraulic products, electrical power distribution and control equipment for vehicle, industrial, commercial and aerospace markets.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767</p>
